18:35.610 --> 18:36.210
Kak.

18:36.390 --> 18:37.400
Jangan sentuh aku.

18:37.400 --> 18:37.960
Sakit.

18:40.240 --> 18:40.720
Tuan Gu,

18:41.070 --> 18:42.600
